<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS cuts Apria to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS cuts Apria to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded Apria Healthcare Group Inc to hold from buy, citing fourth quarter results below expectations.</p>
<p>-- Maintained 1997 estimate at $1.65 a share but cut 1998 estimate to $1.65 from $2.00.  Set a 1999 estimate of $2.00.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 17-3/4.</p>
</text>
